/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (Transfer learning reuses knowledge learned by a neural network on a large source dataset for a different target task. Here, VGG16, ResNet50 and EfficientNet-B0 are loaded with ImageNet pretrained weights. Their convolutional base is frozen, and a new binary classification layer is added for Cat/Dog classification. )
