<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 73 0 R
/E (Themodel havingthe highest validation Accuracy and F1-Score can be considered the best performer for this experiment. Precision and Recall should also be checked to understand the classification behaviour. Because the dataset is intentionally small and the experiment uses only two epochs, the results are primarily for educational comparison rather than a production benchmark. )
/Pg 16 0 R
