174 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 74 0 R
/E (Theimage-classification experiment was implemented using TensorFlow/Keras. VGG16, ResNet50 and EfficientNet-B0 reused ImageNet pretrained features while the final binary classifier was trained for Cat-vs-Dog classification. An AlexNet-style CNN was also implemented as a baseline. Accuracy, Precision, Recall and F1-Score were used for comparison. The actual experimental results determine the final ranking of the models. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
